  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Widget Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "widget-panel",
      "description": "The housing every widget shares: title, source/updated meta, refresh.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><header class=\"ds-panel-head\"><h2 class=\"ds-panel-title\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v2\"/><path d=\"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41\"/><path d=\"M20 12h2\"/><path d=\"M15.947 12.65a4 4 0 0 0-5.925-4.128\"/><path d=\"M13 22H7a5 5 0 1 1 4.9-6H13a3 3 0 0 1 0 6Z\"/></svg>Colorado weather</h2><div class=\"ds-panel-meta\"><span>Open-Meteo · <span class=\"ds-num\">Updated 9:24 PM</span></span><button class=\"ds-icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Refresh\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\"/><path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"/><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16\"/><path d=\"M8 16H3v5\"/></svg></button></div></header><div class=\"ds-panel-body\"><span class=\"ds-num ds-readout\">41°</span> <span class=\"ds-meta\">feels 37°</span></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{background:var(--surface);color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:420px}.ds-panel-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}.ds-panel-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0}.ds-panel-meta{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-num{font-family:var(--font-geist-mono),ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-readout{font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.025em}.ds-meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-icon-btn{background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:6px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;transition:background 150ms,color 150ms}.ds-icon-btn:hover{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--fg)}.ds-icon-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Location Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "inner-card",
      "description": "Clickable inner card; hover shifts the border to Signal Blue.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-loc\"><div class=\"ds-loc-name\">Genesee</div><div class=\"ds-loc-sub\">Partly cloudy</div><div class=\"ds-loc-temp\">41°</div><div class=\"ds-loc-sub\">H 52° · L 30°</div></button>",
      "css": ".ds-loc{display:block;text-align:left;width:220px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--surface-2) 50%,transparent);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;color:var(--fg);cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),system-ui,sans-serif;transition:border-color 150ms,background 150ms}.ds-loc:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 60%,transparent);background:var(--surface-2)}.ds-loc:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}.ds-loc-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:500}.ds-loc-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--font-geist-mono),ui-monospace,monospace}.ds-loc-temp{margin-top:12px;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.025em;font-family:var(--font-geist-mono),ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "segmented-option",
      "description": "Two-to-three option toggle used for sorts and modes.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><button class=\"ds-seg-opt is-active\">Upcoming</button><button class=\"ds-seg-opt\">Recent</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:2px;font-size:12px;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-seg-opt{background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;font:inherit;transition:color 150ms,background 150ms}.ds-seg-opt:hover{color:var(--fg)}.ds-seg-opt.is-active{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--fg)}.ds-seg-opt:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:1px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-chip",
      "description": "Fully rounded filter chips; the active one inverts.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip is-active\">Top stories</button><button class=\"ds-chip\">Colorado</button><button class=\"ds-chip\">Business</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:4px;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-chip{border:0;border-radius:9999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px;background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;transition:color 150ms,background 150ms}.ds-chip:hover{color:var(--fg)}.ds-chip.is-active{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Link Pill",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "link-pill",
      "description": "Bordered off-site source link with an external glyph.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-linkpill\" href=\"#\">OpenSnow I-70 <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"/><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"/><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-linkpill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),system-ui,sans-serif;transition:border-color 150ms,color 150ms}.ds-linkpill:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 60%,transparent);color:var(--fg)}.ds-linkpill:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ticker Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "text-input",
      "description": "Compact hairline input; focus shifts the border to Signal Blue.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"Add ticker\" maxlength=\"10\">",
      "css": ".ds-input{width:96px;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--fg);text-transform:uppercase;outline:none;font-family:var(--font-geist-mono),ui-monospace,monospace;transition:border-color 150ms}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--faint);text-transform:none}.ds-input:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Banners",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Tinted stale (amber) and error (coral) banners per the Tint, Don't Fill rule.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-banner ds-warn\">Refresh failed — showing older data from 9:24 PM.</div><div class=\"ds-banner ds-down\"><b>Couldn’t load this widget</b><br><span class=\"ds-banner-sub\">Could not reach the server.</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-banner{border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:380px}.ds-warn{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 40%,transparent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 10%,transparent);color:var(--warn)}.ds-down{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--down) 40%,transparent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--down) 10%,transparent);color:var(--fg);padding:16px;font-size:14px}.ds-banner-sub{color:var(--muted)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Market Status Pill",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Rounded pill with a status dot; green when open.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-pill is-open\"><i></i>US market open</span> <span class=\"ds-pill\"><i></i>US market closed</span>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:9999px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:11px;background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-pill i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--faint)}.ds-pill.is-open{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--up) 15%,transparent);color:var(--up)}.ds-pill.is-open i{background:var(--up)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Morning Instrument Panel",
    "overview": "The Command Center is read the way a pilot reads a cluster of gauges: in quick looks, from a little distance, trusting that every needle is labeled and current. The page is a near-black field of graphite panels, each one a self-contained instrument with its own title, source, update time and refresh control. Numbers are the content, set in Geist Mono with tabular figures so columns hold still as values tick over through the day.\n\nThe system is refined and restrained. Panels are separated by hairline borders and one step of tonal lift, not by shadows. Color is almost absent from the chrome and is reserved for meaning: blue for interaction and the Front Range, cyan for snow and forecasts, green and coral for gains and losses, amber for caution and stale data. Density is high but ordered; a 1500px desktop column fits weather for eight places, four resorts, markets, drive times, news and video without crowding, because hierarchy comes from size and weight, not decoration.\n\nHonesty is a visual concern here. Model estimates, forecasts and observations are distinguished by color and by label in the same glance, and degraded states (stale, needs setup, error) have their own calm, tinted treatments rather than disappearing.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Dark by default (ink black field, graphite panels), with a full light theme swapped through the same token names.",
      "Tabular, monospaced numerals for every reading; sans for words.",
      "Flat, tonal layering: border plus one surface step; shadows only on floating menus.",
      "Semantic-only color; neutral chrome.",
      "Every panel shows source and \"Updated\" time in quiet meta text.",
      "Small, subtle motion: content fades up 4px, skeletons shimmer, refresh icons spin."
